      "updated": 1769101148315,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Action Logger\n----------------\nJust to log each an every action\n–––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"run_id_action_index\": \"run_id#action_index\" // Partition Key\n    \"executed_at\": unixMilli // Sort Key\n    \"log_id\"\n    \"run_id\"\n    \"action_index\"\n    \"action_type\"\n    \"status\"\n    \"result\"\n    \"error_message\"\n    \"duration_ms\"\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli \n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nScheduled Job\n––––––––––\nModel to keep all the jobs that needs to be scheduled along with it's details\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: status_execute_at\n––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    job_id: \"some-unique-ID\" // Partition Key\n    execute_at: unixMilli\n    created_at: unixMilli\n    updated_at: unixMilli,\n    job_name: \"some name not needed unique\"\n    job_details: {\n        // will contain meta info of which signal triggered it and some other info\n    }\n    queue_name: \"name-of-queue\" // Name of the queue where it will be pushed with the job details\n    status: SCHEDULED | RUNNING | COMPLETED\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nWorkflow\n––––––\nModel to keep all the workflows of different versions\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: signal_type_workflow_id (Since one signal type can execute multiple workflows)\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    workflow_id: \"some-unique-ID\" // Partition Key\n    version: int // Sort Key\n    createdAt: unixMilli\n    updatedAt: unixMilli,\n    signal_type: unique_type\n    conditions: []\n    actions: []\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nWorkflow Runs\n––––––––––\nModel to keep the execution flow of each signal run\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: workflow_id_created_at\nGSI: status_created_at (To show all runs)\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"runId\": uuid // PK\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli // SK\n    \"workflow_id\": uuid\n    \"workflow_version\": int\n    \"signal_id\": unique to signal\n    \"status\": TRIGGERED | FAILED | COMPLETED\n    \"current_state\": TRIGGERED | CONDITION_{index} | ACTION_{index}_{status}\n    \"current_eval_index\": //current condition index\n    \"current_action_index\": // current action index\n    \"context\": // meta information\n    \"triggered_at\": // updated after each trigger\n    \"completed_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nSignal\n––––\nModel to keep the signal info that is sent\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––-\nGSI: workflow_id_created_at\nGSI: status_created_at (To show all runs)\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"runId\": uuid // PK\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli // SK\n    \"workflow_id\": uuid\n    \"workflow_version\": int\n    \"signal_id\": unique to signal\n    \"status\": TRIGGERED | FAILED | COMPLETED\n    \"current_state\": TRIGGERED | CONDITION_{index} | ACTION_{index}_{status}\n    \"current_eval_index\": //current condition index\n    \"current_action_index\": // current action index\n    \"context\": // meta information\n    \"triggered_at\": // updated after each trigger\n    \"completed_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Action Logger\n----------------\nJust to log each an every action\n–––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"run_id_action_index\": \"run_id#action_index\" // Partition Key\n    \"executed_at\": unixMilli // Sort Key\n    \"log_id\"\n    \"run_id\"\n    \"action_index\"\n    \"action_type\"\n    \"status\"\n    \"result\"\n    \"error_message\"\n    \"duration_ms\"\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli \n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nScheduled Job\n––––––––––\nModel to keep all the jobs that needs to be scheduled along with it's details\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: status_execute_at\n––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    job_id: \"some-unique-ID\" // Partition Key\n    execute_at: unixMilli\n    created_at: unixMilli\n    updated_at: unixMilli,\n    job_name: \"some name not needed unique\"\n    job_details: {\n        // will contain meta info of which signal triggered it and some other info\n    }\n    queue_name: \"name-of-queue\" // Name of the queue where it will be pushed with the job details\n    status: SCHEDULED | RUNNING | COMPLETED\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nWorkflow\n––––––\nModel to keep all the workflows of different versions\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: signal_type_workflow_id (Since one signal type can execute multiple workflows)\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    workflow_id: \"some-unique-ID\" // Partition Key\n    version: int // Sort Key\n    createdAt: unixMilli\n    updatedAt: unixMilli,\n    signal_type: unique_type\n    conditions: []\n    actions: []\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nWorkflow Runs\n––––––––––\nModel to keep the execution flow of each signal run\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nGSI: workflow_id_created_at\nGSI: status_created_at (To show all runs)\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"runId\": uuid // PK\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli // SK\n    \"workflow_id\": uuid\n    \"workflow_version\": int\n    \"signal_id\": unique to signal\n    \"status\": TRIGGERED | FAILED | COMPLETED\n    \"current_state\": TRIGGERED | CONDITION_{index} | ACTION_{index}_{status}\n    \"current_eval_index\": //current condition index\n    \"current_action_index\": // current action index\n    \"context\": // meta information\n    \"triggered_at\": // updated after each trigger\n    \"completed_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\nSignal\n––––\nModel to keep the signal info that is sent\n–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––-\nGSI: workflow_id_created_at\nGSI: status_created_at (To show all runs)\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n{\n    \"runId\": uuid // PK\n    \"created_at\": unixMilli // SK\n    \"workflow_id\": uuid\n    \"workflow_version\": int\n    \"signal_id\": unique to signal\n    \"status\": TRIGGERED | FAILED | COMPLETED\n    \"current_state\": TRIGGERED | CONDITION_{index} | ACTION_{index}_{status}\n    \"current_eval_index\": //current condition index\n    \"current_action_index\": // current action index\n    \"context\": // meta information\n    \"triggered_at\": // updated after each trigger\n    \"completed_at\": unixMilli\n    \"updated_at\": unixMilli\n}\n––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––––\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
